---
// Small pulsing dot marking live data; the pulse is dropped under reduced motion.
---

<span aria-hidden="true" class="relative inline-flex size-2 shrink-0">
  <span class="absolute inline-flex size-full rounded-full bg-primary opacity-60 motion-safe:animate-ping"></span>
  <span class="relative inline-flex size-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
</span>
